,"close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Canada's most popular spot for ice cream! A trip to Cows is unlike any other ice cream experience. The smell of fresh made waffle cones will lure you in through the door, but you will stay for the apparel! Cows not only offers a bounty of creatively named (and delicious) ice cream flavours like \"Gooey Mooey\" or \"Wowie Cowie\", but the store sells t-shirts for women, men, and children that are humor","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Charlottetown"},{"id":"charlottetown_wv_the_dining_room_at_the_culinary_institute","areaId":"charlottetown","name":"The Dining Room at The Culinary Institute","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":46.2302,"lng":-63.1299},"visitMinutes":75,"photoSeed":"charlottetown_wv_the_dining_room_at_the_culinary_institute","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.theculinary.ca/default.aspx","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["thediningroomattheculinaryinstitute","charlottetown"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"At the Culinary Institute of Canada, a well respected school for chefs. The students prepare and serve meals under the tutelage of their instructors. The food is classically and competently prepared. The dining room has an excellent view over Charlottetown Harbour, though the institute's building is hopelessly municipal in appearance. Begins service at 6PM, reservations requested.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Charlottetown"},{"id":"charlottetown_wv_splendid_essence","areaId":"charlottetown","name":"Splendid Essence","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":46.2375,"lng":-63.1263},"visitMinutes":75,"photoSeed":"charlottetown_wv_splendid_essence","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://splendidessence.com/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["splendidessence","charlottetown"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"04:30","close":"20:00"},{"open":"04:30","close":"20:00"},{"open":"04:30","close":"20:00"},{"open":"04:30","close":"20:00"},{"open":"04:30","close":"20:00"},{"open":"04:30","close":"20:00"},{"open":"04:30","close":"20:00"}]},"summary":"Provides shockingly inexpensive vegetarian meals. Serving a selection of fine Asian teas, dim sum treats like dumplings, and large bowls of noodles, vegetables and vegetarian \"ham\", you won't go hungry. The menu is small but every item on it is delicious and very reasonably priced.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Charlottetown"},{"id":"charlottetown_wv_cedar_s_eatery","areaId":"charlottetown","name":"Cedar's Eatery","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":46.23656,"lng":-63.1284},"visitMinutes":75,"photoSeed":"charlottetown_wv_cedar_s_eatery","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://www.cedarseatery.ca/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["cedarseatery","charlottetown"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"11:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"21:00"},null],"note":"Closed Sun"},"summary":"Great Lebanese food and reasonable prices. They have won many awards and have a great atmosphere. Shish Taouk, Falafel and other traditional dishes are prepared much more thoughtfully and are far tastier than the normal hole-in-the-wall Mediterranean joints in most cities.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Charlottetown"},{"id":"charlottetown_wv_the_gahan_house","areaId":"charlottetown","name":"The Gahan House","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":46.2335,"lng":-63.12595},"visitMinutes":75,"photoSeed":"charlottetown_wv_the_gahan_house",